flowchart TD
    A[Trigger: new UI, redesign, vague visual request, or generic output] --> B{Artefacts already exist and current?}
    B -- yes --> B1[Read them; resume at the first incomplete stage]
    B -- no --> C

    C[1 GRILL: who, what job, success, out of scope, constraints] --> C1{Can you state what and for whom in 2 sentences?}
    C1 -- no --> C2[Owner-only gap? ask-the-owner and PAUSE] --> C
    C1 -- yes --> D

    D[2 BRIEF: read codebase first, then audience, tone, references] --> D1[State the one-line DESIGN READ]
    D1 --> D2{Audience, tone and references named?}
    D2 -- no --> D
    D2 -- yes --> E

    E[3 ARCHITECTURE: routes, nav, hierarchy, URL state] --> E1[Each flow: entry, steps, success state, failure state]
    E1 --> E2{Every screen reachable and every flow has a failure state?}
    E2 -- no --> E
    E2 -- yes --> F

    F[4 TOKENS: primitive, then semantic, then component] --> F1[Read palettes/project-palettes.json; claim an UNUSED OKLCH hue]
    F1 --> F2[Type scale + measure; motion duration/easing; reduced-motion at token layer]
    F2 --> F3{Contrast passes 4.5:1 in BOTH light and dark?}
    F3 -- no --> F
    F3 -- yes --> G

    G[5 TASKS: foundation, core UI, responsive, polish] --> G1{Multi-session or resumable?}
    G1 -- yes --> G2[Scaffold docs/features/slug/00-tracker.json]
    G1 -- no --> H
    G2 --> H

    H[6 BUILD: mobile-first 320 up, tokens only, states built not deferred] --> I

    I[7 REVIEW: RUN the app, do not read the code] --> I1[320/375/768/1024/1440/1920 + keyboard + contrast + empty/loading/error + reduced-motion]
    I1 --> J{Findings?}
    J -- yes --> K[Fix, then re-run the checklist] --> I
    J -- no --> L([Done: artefacts recorded, decisions in their canonical home])

    B1 --> C
